{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17349","headline":"酬崔舍人阁老冬至日宿直省中奉简两掖阁老幷见示 · 权德舆","name":"酬崔舍人阁老冬至日宿直省中奉简两掖阁老幷见示","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"令节一阳新，西垣宿近臣。\n晓光连凤沼，残漏近鸡人。\n白雪飞成曲，黄钟律应均。\n层霄翔迅羽，广陌驻归轮。\n清切晨趋贵，恩华夜直频。\n辍才时所重，分命秩皆真。\n左掖期连茹，南宫愧积薪。\n九年叨此地，回首倍相亲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"权德舆","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17349.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17349","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}